      "reason": "A currency without its ISO name cannot be rendered by the invoicing consumer, which refuses to print a bare code. The name is not arbitrary: it is the reviewed ISO vocabulary in datasets/currencies.yaml, looked up by the row\u0027s own code. A code the vocabulary does not know (the seeded ZZZ row) is left unpatched and listed at the gate \u2014 inventing a name for an unknown code is exactly what this pipeline refuses to do.",
